{"3766240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rust Rides", "steam_appid": 3766240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/5d66be87eab6a24059ab552d2e2a6d5a.avif?t=1786868702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras_big/5d66be87eab6a24059ab552d2e2a6d5a.webp?t=1786868702 width=1560 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Three dimensions of chaos under one ambitious project.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about artificial limitations and imposed rules. <strong>Rust Rides</strong> --- is the ultimate playground where you choose your own style of play right from the main menu. It is a spiritual successor to classic sandboxes, combining drive, freedom and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true FPV experience:</strong> Connect your favorite RC remote and take to the skies. Realistic flight physics await you with a fair Acro mode for those who know how to tame a drone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Drive:</strong> Step on the gas in dynamic races where speed is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Sandbox:</strong> Fly into procedurally generated maps with your friends. Walk, shoot, roll and destroy everything in your path. Our neurophysical model ensures that every destruction in real time will look epic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the creator of this world.</strong> The game is tightly integrated with Steam Workshop and our own social ecosystem <strong>TrSocial</strong>. Download modifications in one click, find new authors, read modders' blogs or become one of them. Your content, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/5d66be87eab6a24059ab552d2e2a6d5a.avif?t=1786868702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras_big/5d66be87eab6a24059ab552d2e2a6d5a.webp?t=1786868702 width=1560 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Three dimensions of chaos under one ambitious project.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about artificial limitations and imposed rules. <strong>Rust Rides</strong> --- is the ultimate playground where you choose your own style of play right from the main menu. It is a spiritual successor to classic sandboxes, combining drive, freedom and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true FPV experience:</strong> Connect your favorite RC remote and take to the skies. Realistic flight physics await you with a fair Acro mode for those who know how to tame a drone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Drive:</strong> Step on the gas in dynamic races where speed is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Sandbox:</strong> Fly into procedurally generated maps with your friends. Walk, shoot, roll and destroy everything in your path. Our neurophysical model ensures that every destruction in real time will look epic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the creator of this world.</strong> The game is tightly integrated with Steam Workshop and our own social ecosystem <strong>TrSocial</strong>. Download modifications in one click, find new authors, read modders' blogs or become one of them. Your content, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Fly drones, race, or cause total destruction with your friends. Rust Rides is a multiplayer sandbox game with Steam Workshop support, procedurally generated worlds, and realistic physics where you set the rules of the game. It's fun.", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/d47b85156a4a13680d766f23379e079993ef761a/header.jpg?t=1786868702", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/da4d73e6586ff1a3217791e3cf2e65f7355fe6ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786868702", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/da4d73e6586ff1a3217791e3cf2e65f7355fe6ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786868702", "website": "http://tryzillyast.zzz.com.ua", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4150<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Disk: HDD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3080 10GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Disk: SSD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"mi